{#
  One template for every edition, replacing thirteen hand-written
  src/<slug>/index.njk files and thirteen .11tydata.js loaders.

  Those files differed only in four strings each, all of which already lived in
  clusters.json — so adding an edition meant copying two files and editing the
  same facts in a second place. That is the shape of duplication that produced
  the accent drift and the empty neighborhood line. Adding an edition is now
  one row of JSON.

  Everything is configured in editions.11tydata.js beside this file, because
  pagination callbacks and computed data need real functions rather than
  YAML strings. The body is empty: cluster-layout.njk renders the page.
#}
